================================================================================
Project acknowledgments
================================================================================

This work builds on common audio ML practice (MFCC / Log-Mel features,
CNN and classical ML classifiers) using the libraries listed above.
Documentation and pipeline design target an embedded acoustic drone-
detection use case (e.g. ESP32-S3 class hardware); hardware brand names
are used for identification only and imply no affiliation or endorsement.
